/-!
# Efron bootstrap mean

This directory proves almost-sure consistency of Efron's nonparametric bootstrap for a sample
mean of a measurable real statistic with a finite second moment.  It supplies the empirical
triangular-array conditions, Gaussian weak convergence, and Kolmogorov-distance consistency.
